  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"Serilum 的模组。充满爱意打造。为 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 提供了大量活跃模组！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg&w=400\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg&w=400\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"关于模组\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Stack Refill 是一款实用模组，当背包中存在相同物品时，会自动为玩家手中的物品堆进行补充。它适用于战斗中的武器、挖掘方块的工具、放置方块时的堆叠、食用食物、使用药水、向地面投掷物品、饮用牛奶桶以及收回鱼竿等场景，并且预计能兼容所有模组方块。这是我最喜欢的个人便利性优化之一。<br><br>为了获得最佳稳定性，必须在<strong>客户端</strong>和<strong>服务端</strong>同时安装。也可以仅在服务端使用，但这可能会导致一些视觉不同步的问题。</span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"依赖项\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg&w=502\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/modpack/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg&w=700\" alt=\"包含在 The Vanilla Experience 中\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/serilums-qol-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/qol-bundle.svg&w=668\" alt=\"包含在 Serilum&#x27;s QoL Bundle 中\" width=\"334\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/both.svg&w=586\" alt=\"运行环境：客户端与服务端\" width=\"293\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>战斗中自动更换剑：</strong></span></p>\n<details><summary>显示详情</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/stack-refill/a.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"584\"></p>\n</details>\n<p><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>挖掘泥土时自动更换铲子：</strong></span></p>\n<details><summary>显示详情</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/stack-refill/b.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"584\"></p>\n</details>\n<p><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>放置原木方块时自动更换：</strong></span></p>\n<details><summary>显示详情</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/stack-refill/c.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"586\"></p>\n</details>\n<p><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>食用面包后自动补充：</strong></span></p>\n<details><summary>显示详情</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/stack-refill/d.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"588\"></p>\n</details>\n<p><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>使用药水后自动补充：</strong></span></p>\n<details><summary>显示详情</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/stack-refill/e.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"588\"></p>\n</details>\n<p><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>投掷物品后自动补充：</strong></span></p>\n<details><summary>显示详情</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/stack-refill/f.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"608\"></p>\n</details>\n<p><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>饮用牛奶桶后自动补充：</strong></span></p>\n<details><summary>显示详情</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/stack-refill/g.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"580\"></p>\n</details>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>最后一次使用后收回的新鱼竿：</strong></span></p>\n<details><summary>显示详情</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/stack-refill/h.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"580\"></p>\n</details>\n<p><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>对（模组）方块使用物品时，例如来自 Ex Nihilo 的筛子：</strong></span></p>\n<details><summary>显示详情</summary>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/stack-refill/i.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"516\"></span></p>\n</details>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"注意事项与链接\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>只要下载源仍托管于 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生态内，您可自由在任何整合包中使用本模组。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 包含了所有可用模组的概览及更多信息。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>如有问题、建议、想法或其他任何事宜，请访问&nbsp;<a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github 仓库</a>。感谢支持！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
